---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: 標籤
permalink: /tags/
---
<article class="page">
  <h1 class="page-title">標籤</h1>
  {%- if collections.tagList.length %}
  <ul class="tag-cloud">
    {%- for tag in collections.tagList %}
    <li><a href="{{ tag.name | tagUrl }}"><span class="tag-cloud-name">#{{ tag.name }}</span><span class="tag-cloud-count">{{ tag.count }} 篇</span></a></li>
    {%- endfor %}
  </ul>
  {%- else %}
  <p class="empty-note">還沒有任何標籤。在文章開頭的 tags 欄位加上主題，例如「日文」，這裡就會列出來。</p>
  {%- endif %}
</article>
